It's not 100% necessary to have cure sickness to ascend, but it is a useful 
spell to have. If you decide you want it, you can cast polymorph and have 
acess to a wand of polymorph; you could polypile spellbooks you don't need 
in the hope of creating one.

Are you crowned? If not, be careful not to be while praying for spellbooks 
by manipulating your luck. If you are, praying repeatedly will be a long 
and painful process.

> - Is AC -34 enough for the endgame?

Yes. It's on the higher end of the range though - see below for comments 
on your armour. Also, make sure you have at least 9 points of intrinsic 
protection.

> - Any other spellbook I'd want?

I can't see anything missing initially - magic missile is what I always 
want. Magic mapping makes gehennom less tedious, but is certainly optional.

