Frost Brand is very good, but IIRC, the Astral plane contains many cold-
resistant creatures, so a backup could be useful. There are very few 
creatures both fire and frost resistant, so you could take Fire Brand as an 
alternative. Snickersnee is a worthwhile weapon too, and should work 
equally well on all enemies.

> - Should I carry those 13 daggers I have in my stash? I am restricted
